OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to convert playground into
OL,4,Aartificial pitch
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been submitted for a new
OL,7,Fsports pitch at a prep school with the
OL,8,Faim of providing a year-round playing
OL,9,Fsurface.
OL,11,FJersey College for Girls Primary School
OL,12,Fin St Saviour proposed the conversion
OL,13,Fof its existing playground area into an
OL,14,Fartificial turf pitch suitable for
OL,15,Ffootball and other sports.
OL,17,FIn the application the school said the
OL,18,Fsurface of the current play area was
OL,19,Fworn and no longer met the school's
OL,20,Ffunctional requirements.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
